acceptance_criteria: "Every route currently declared by Monica main routes/api.php is represented by a typed CLI command and versioned reference entry; Stable 4.x compatibility remains complete and next-edition commands classify unsupported versus unavailable safely; All help, docs, output schemas, agent catalogs, setup/doctor guidance, and changelog state match runtime behavior; Exact 100/100/100/100 source coverage, 100 percent docstrings, under-300-LOC source files, zero duplication/security/privacy findings, packed npm/Bun proof, PM validation, and read-only live acceptance pass"
why_now: "Authoritative main has a concrete public API that differs from frozen stable 4.x, and latest-version compatibility now requires explicit edition modeling."
